# Airtable migration secrets and raw exports. The token authenticates to the live base, and the
# exports carry employees' government IDs, bank certificates and receipts -- none of it belongs in
# history. The generated schema/data SQL under migrations/outputs stays tracked.
/migrations/.token*
/migrations/outputs/**/export/
/migrations/generate/__pycache__/
*.pyc
